  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3121.03 Effect of Revocation or Suspension of Certificate on License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3121.03 Effect of Revocation or Suspension of Certificate on License. If a hearings examiner revokes or suspends a driver education instructor certificate and determines that the conduct of the instructor has a direct bearing on the operation of an approved drivers’ school, a hearing shall be scheduled to determine whether to suspend or revoke the approved drivers’ school license.\n\nSource. #13171, eff 2-22-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c3100.html"
